    },
    {
      "claim": "Esarhaddon was succeeded by Sandoshina.",
      "tag": "superseded",
      "quote_britannica": "He died in the year of the week SSS, and was faceded by Sandoshina.",
      "quote_wikipedia": "to his two sons and heirs Ashurbanipal as ruler of the empire and Šamaš-šuma-ukin as king of Babylonia after his death."
    },
    {
      "claim": "Esarhaddon is identified as the Shanghai.",
      "tag": "dropped",
      "quote_britannica": "Elarhaddon, in the opinion of Sir Ilane Newton, seems to be the Shanghai who often, as Catecharina fayo,",
      "quote_wikipedia": null
